add(S,'ambiguity-governance-rule','constraint','A major constitutional or realization boundary has material unresolved interpretation.',
    'Detect and record major ambiguity, affected invariant/asset/decision and any decision to proceed with resolved/carried/escalated/blocked handling; declared risk policy chooses lawful probabilistic processing or explicit human adjudication except hard stops.',
    ['Major ambiguity affects architecture/stack/Product boundary/admissibility/public contract or downstream law; micro choices remain inside accepted design.', 'Preserve substrate-neutral meaning; ODD F_D/F_P/F_H do not enter without explicit relation.', 'Risk appetite cannot waive invariant/guarantee violation, absent required authority, missing declared operational capability, undeclared irreversible effect or explicit human gate.', 'Observe uncertain/undeclared effects before dependent action; stop labels do not prove no performance/effect.'],
    ['Policy may carry or resolve declared ambiguity progressively; not all ambiguity must be eliminated before work.'], ['Exact ambiguity, current evidence, declared risk policy, approvals/capabilities and actual effects.'], SG,
    'Resolution predicate: established resolution satisfied, established remaining ambiguity falsified, insufficient evidence indeterminate; preserve basis/scope diagnosis. Handling-lawfulness is separate: authorized handling satisfies, violated policy falsifies, unsupported handling indeterminate. Carried/escalated does not resolve ambiguity or settle delivery.')
add(S,'operational-lifecycle-sufficiency-rule','constraint','Any material Product/application/module/function/runtime/plugin/public-interface/data/capability lifecycle.',
    'Constitution supports deriving intent -> requirement -> build -> assurance -> release -> deployment -> live use -> telemetry -> retirement, or explicitly governs unresolved phases.',
    ['Product names material boundary/use/release-install/live-use/observability/retirement-supersession posture.', 'Requirements state lifecycle invariants; deferral names later-resolution owner.', 'Non-applicable phase needs reason; unknown phase needs named gap. Design cannot invent missing meaning from convention/code/prompt/fixture; reprice constitution or carry governed debt.'],
    ['No detailed phase mechanism or release plan is required in every requirement.'], ['Material lifecycle scope, constitutional signal, gaps and deferral authority.'])
add(S,'change-management-rule','constraint','Any substantive change.',
    'Begin with intake triage, explicit change intent and lawful constitutional re-entry.', ['Do not bypass intake.'], [], ['Substantiveness determination and triage.'], ['SPEC_METHOD.universal-intake-triage'])
add(S,'universal-intake-triage','constraint','Bug, feature, issue, regression, operator finding, release blocker, scenario failure or other substantive intake.',
    'One intake determines substantiveness, affected Product/scope, lawful class/re-entry, downstream rederive/reprice/reproof and release-scope disposition, independent of intake label.',
    ['Do not jump to code/tests/release; combine applicable frames on same subject/basis with material variables/evidence, preserving alternatives and smallest sufficient repair scope.', 'Failure-exposing frame need not contain cause; renamed repetition adds no evidence.', 'Choose smallest sufficient frame configuration with existing independence/repair authority, not fixed reviewer count/new round.', 'Class mapping: goal_reprice -> Goals and affected downstream; intent_reprice -> Intent onward; product_reprice -> Product onward with Intent stable; requirement_reprice -> Requirements onward with direction stable; design_reframe -> Design onward with Intent/requirements stable; realization_refactor -> realization only with no upstream drift.', 'Below-Goals change explicitly asserts unchanged upstream constitution; missing class is drift.'],
    ['Reuse current valid support; no separate tracking bureaucracy is required.'], ['Exact report/current Product, observations/retained results, assessment grant, desired change and authority walk.'], SG+['SPEC_METHOD.counterexample-localization','SPEC_METHOD.computed-classification-and-treatment'])
add(S,'counterexample-localization','constraint','Assurance/intake requires causal diagnosis on a declared path.',
    'Return the earliest supported causal frontier: unique violated locus, jointly necessary incomparable earliest loci, unresolved alternative frontiers or no supported bounded frontier. Earliest means minimal in causal relation, not clock order.',
    ['Record subject/basis/frontier/members/causal evidence/expected relations/counterexample/downstream invalidations.', 'Do not collapse joint cause to arbitrary owner or alternatives to joint cause.', 'Localization authorizes no expanded tests/compatibility repairs/controller/upstream reinterpretation; changes re-enter their owner.'],
    ['No extra localization pass for every change.'], ['Declared causal path, counterexample and distinguishing causal evidence.'], ['FOUNDATIONS.result-algebra'],
    'Evidence-establishes-earliest-frontier: supported unique/joint frontier satisfies; alternatives/no bounded support/missing reason indeterminate; counterevidence falsifies; invalid causal basis invalid_basis; outside scope/capability out_of_frame. Retain performance/effects and original failing claim; localization is not repair success.')
add(S,'computed-classification-and-treatment','constraint','Classifying an exact requested change or reusing its computed evidence.',
    'One reusable C exposes authority traversal, complete Public membership/value delta, accepted-design coverage and rule treatment; J is residual semantic/materiality judgment and O reserved owner ruling, with no invented runtime or authority.',
    ['Bind request/outcome/targets/effects/grant/lifetime, Product/basis, baseline/candidate, relations/accepted design/traces/evidence/rules; record producer/procedure revision/inputs/result/scope/routes/reproduction/unknowns/invalidators.', 'Traverse source/owner/dependency/composition/projection to sufficient frontier; equal Public bytes do not exclude root/authority/grant change.', 'Enumerate full relevant serialized universe including helper/generated dependencies; report additions/removals/changed retained values with exact before/after. Rename is remove+add absent owner identity relation; missing candidate/incomplete enumeration/ambiguous identity/unavailable projection stays unknown.', 'Join changed bytes/relations to accepted scope/traces/acceptance; artifact/path/digest alone proves no coverage.', 'Apply only declared rules with sufficient premises; expose re-entry/action/evidence/reserved ruling/lifetime and conflicts; invent no J when rules settle.', 'Candidate failure alone does not require law change: sufficient law supports granted repair/rejection; changed desired meaning or proven insufficiency re-enters actual owner. Unknown treatment withholds reliance/promotion.', 'Refresh affected C after request/candidate/basis/root/owner/projection/design/rule/config/evidence change; retain original cause/attempt/effects/surviving facts/J dependencies and widen where independence unproved.'],
    ['Bounded authorized construction/evidence may permit cheapest useful discriminator, including first candidate, without conformance claim.', 'Correct mistaken route at smallest affected owner.'], ['Exact request/authority graph, complete baseline/candidate projection, design acceptance/traces, declared rules/evidence and grants.'], SG,
    'Differs predicate: changed satisfies, complete equality falsifies, incomplete comparison indeterminate. Accepted-design-covers predicate: current accepted scope/trace/acceptance satisfies; proven absence/exclusion falsifies; missing/stale/ambiguous undeciding support indeterminate. Exclusion from design is not evaluator out_of_frame. Preserve basis/scope/missing-reason/independent evidence. Treatment tests rule premises; ruling is a separate decision.')
add(S,'consistency-gate-rule','constraint','Closing the affected declared change span.',
    'All applicable obligations/judgments/rulings hold without active non-closure; upstream is sufficient, downstream consistent and tests/qualification prove current intended behavior.',
    ['Local artifact fitness is not whole-span closure.', 'Reconcile code/test mismatch through admitted ticket, triage, re-entry and source authority, not code precedent.'],
    ['Reuse exact applicable closure evidence under workspace and ticket law.'], ['Current affected surfaces, required rulings/evaluations and proof authority.'], SG+['TICKET_METHOD.test-case-authority'])
add(S,'product-outcome-conservation-stdo-up-013','constraint','Product-outcome-bearing wave, growth admission or progress claim.',
    'Select an unresolved directly verifiable Product-defined outcome instance and acceptance interval; growth needs that live basis or its admitted bounded prerequisite/decision-discriminating experiment.',
    ['Only material advance is Product progress; keep readiness, preservation and regression distinct.', 'Acceptance exhausts that instance/interval, not recurring guarantees or broader family; next defined outcome is Goals selection, changed/new meaning is Product re-entry.', 'Evidence cannot select/enlarge outcome; assurance delivery counts when defined as Product behavior with separate output/evidence roles.', 'Prerequisite/experiment grants only provisional bound, not downstream growth/promotion/closure/waiver; work-wave owner/proxy durably admits with exhaustion/falsification condition.', 'Acceptance, prerequisite discharge, experiment resolution or other admitted terminal/rejected/withdrawn/superseded/repriced/falsified condition ends basis; repair/continuation/status/evidence/prior admission cannot renew it.', 'Retention/regression/donor material gives no growth grant; salvage carries only re-adopted semantics, not old authority/dependencies/completion.', 'Regression/gap blocks affected-path promotion until repair/reprice/owner acceptance; outcome success is not full Product/release closure.'],
    ['Independent parallel work can proceed on its own basis, without laundering its progress into this outcome.', 'One artifact may be Product output/evidence for separately declared claims.'], ['Exact outcome/interval, movement, live grant/exhaustion, owner admissions and path gaps.'], SG,
    'Materially-advances predicate: advance satisfies; prerequisite-only/preservation-only/regression falsifies; unmeasured/undecidable movement indeterminate, retaining scope/basis diagnoses. Readiness/preservation have different predicates and can satisfy independently.')
add(S,'proportional-method-and-delivery-stdo-up-014','constraint','Material method burden or delivery prioritization.',
    'Semantic interpretation space removed must justify effective reasoning complexity: concepts/owners/joins/exceptions/states/duplicate reconciliation/deciding detail, not raw lines/artifacts/context size.',
    ['Identify material ambiguity removed; authority/failure/evidence uncertainty counts where it changes admissible interpretations, not as separate benefit.', 'Do not prescribe internal strategy where variation cannot affect governed meaning/authority/evidence/safety/release.', 'Repeated acquisition/hashing/preparation/review/accounting serves a named change/decision/assurance; material operational assumptions need UP-019 qualification.', 'Prioritize by outcome, likelihood/impact/reversibility/dependencies/feedback delay without waiving hard stops.', 'Default advances smallest supported Product path/high-value likely failures; displacing defense/prerequisite names claim/evidence/bound/return/consequence.'],
    ['One family rationale suffices; no per-clause receipt, universal quota or new accounting carrier.', 'Detailed symbolic design can be proportional if it resolves material alternatives within capacity; capability grants no authority.', 'Existing obligations may absorb detail preserving ownership/meaning; no fixed global schedule follows.'], ['Material interpretation alternatives, reasoning burden, cost/value evidence, outcome and operational assumptions.'], ['TRANSFORMATION_LIBRARY.constraint-surface'])
